|----------------------------------|-----------------------------|----------------------------------------|
| Missing input validation         | Injection, XSS              | `express-validator`                    |
| No security headers              | Clickjacking, XSS           | `helmet`                               |
| No rate limiting                 | Brute-force, DDoS           | `express-rate-limit`                   |
| No HTTPS                         | MITM attacks                | Enforce HTTPS                          |
| No error handling                | Info leakage                | Global error handler                   |
| No CORS restrictions             | Unauthorized access         | `cors` middleware                      |
| No authentication                | Data leaks                  | JWT/OAuth2                             |

---

